{"unit_id":"Weiyang742__dsh-cross-session-messaging#card-zh","repo":"Weiyang742/dsh-cross-session-messaging","commit":"0af18721fcfcf1298c14cefe2a99f31912f88171","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cross-Session Relay 是一款面向 DSH Web 和命令行会话的消息插件。它在 DSH 中注册会话发现、消息发送和收件箱管理工具，并通过本地 Unix socket 或可选的跨机器 TCP 连接中继独立会话间的文本。用户可以查找可达会话、按名称或会话标识发送消息、查看待处理消息并决定接收或拒绝。收件会话会把消息作为 relay 文本送入 agent；插件还支持队列持久化与失败重试。适合需要让不同 DSH 会话交换信息的场景；运行需要 Node.js 24.11 或更高版本，跨机器使用需配置 peer。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:7-72","src/agent/inject.ts:13-32","src/transport/server.ts:37-58","package.json:28-29"]}
{"unit_id":"Weiyang742__dsh-cross-session-messaging#card-en","repo":"Weiyang742/dsh-cross-session-messaging","commit":"0af18721fcfcf1298c14cefe2a99f31912f88171","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Cross-Session Relay connects independent DSH sessions for peer discovery and text messaging. Tools list peers, send by name or ID, and manage held messages. Incoming text is relayed to the agent. Local use needs Node.js 24.11+; optional TCP connects configured remote peers.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:7-72","src/agent/inject.ts:13-32","src/transport/server.ts:37-58","package.json:28-29"]}
